{"seq":2,"slug":"long-tail-head-analysis","title":"头部 vs 长尾 query 分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/query-log-analytics-insight/intent-distribution/long-tail-head-analysis","wordCount":3020,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"头部-vs-长尾-query-分析\">头部 vs 长尾 query 分析</h1><p>搜索流量的量级分布是一条极端陡峭的曲线：几万个头部词拿走一半以上的请求量，剩下的散落在数以亿计的罕见组合里。这条曲线的形状不是一个学术趣闻，它直接决定了几件很实际的事——缓存该给谁、运营该管谁、模型该对谁调优、长尾到底值不值得投入。把「长尾」当成一个笼统的剩余项，是最常见的分析错误：长尾内部并非同质，它至少包含<strong>中频词</strong>和<strong>真长尾</strong>两段性质完全不同的群体，处理策略也完全不同。</p>\n<p>这一节与 <a href=\"intent-category-distribution\">按意图/品类的 query 分布</a> 构成同一批数据的两个切面：那边按语义维度切分，这边按量级维度切分，两者交叉之后才能得到「头部的哪个意图出了问题」「长尾的哪个品类在增长」这样的结论。长尾分析的另一个直接用途是成本决策，因为长尾的边际单位成本远高于头部——同样的投入，作用于头部能影响百万用户，作用于单条长尾词只影响几十人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"按累计份额切成三段\">按累计份额切成三段</h3><p>分布的刻画不能只有一个「长尾」标签。业界通常按量级切成三段：头部（head）、躯干（torso/中频）、尾部（tail）。切分点没有普适数值，取决于你的日请求总量，通常用<strong>累计份额</strong>而非绝对次数来定义：按 query 频次降序排列，累计到 50% 的位置以上是头部，到 90% 的位置之间是躯干，其余为尾部。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[全量 query 按频次降序] --&gt; B{累计份额}&#10;    B --&gt;|0-50%| C[头部 Head&lt;br/&gt;约 1万-10万词]&#10;    B --&gt;|50-90%| D[躯干 Torso&lt;br/&gt;约 10万-100万词]&#10;    B --&gt;|90-100%| E[尾部 Tail&lt;br/&gt;千万级以上]&#10;    C --&gt; F[缓存/人工运营/专项优化]&#10;    D --&gt; G[自动归一/同义词/排序泛化]&#10;    E --&gt; H[容量长尾成本/零结果挖掘]&#10;    F --&gt; I[策略输出]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[全量 query 按频次降序] --&gt; B{累计份额}\n    B --&gt;|0-50%| C[头部 Head&lt;br/&gt;约 1万-10万词]\n    B --&gt;|50-90%| D[躯干 Torso&lt;br/&gt;约 10万-100万词]\n    B --&gt;|90-100%| E[尾部 Tail&lt;br/&gt;千万级以上]\n    C --&gt; F[缓存/人工运营/专项优化]\n    D --&gt; G[自动归一/同义词/排序泛化]\n    E --&gt; H[容量长尾成本/零结果挖掘]\n    F --&gt; I[策略输出]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分层</th>\n<th>累计份额</th>\n<th>词量级</th>\n<th>单次可覆盖用户</th>\n<th>主要策略</th>\n<th>单位成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>头部</td>\n<td>0–50%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>缓存、人工运营、定制召回</td>\n<td>低（摊薄）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>躯干</td>\n<td>50–90%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>同义词归一、排序泛化</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾部</td>\n<td>90–100%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>成本控制、语义兜底</td>\n<td>高（不可摊薄）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"zipf-定律与分布拟合\">Zipf 定律与分布拟合</h2><h3 id=\"zipf-参数与业务信号\">Zipf 参数与业务信号</h3><p>这条曲线大体服从 <strong>Zipf 定律</strong>：排名第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的 query，其频率近似与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的某个幂成反比</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(r) \\propto \\frac{1}{r^{s}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>电商搜索的经验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 值通常在 0.7 到 1.0 之间。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 偏离 1 的程度本身就是一个业务信号：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 变小（曲线更平）说明流量在向更多词分散，可能意味着用户行为更碎片化、或推荐/个性化把流量打散了；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 变大（曲线更陡）说明流量更集中在少数词上，常见于大促、突发事件、或头部品牌垄断。</p>\n<p>参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的估计用<strong>对数-对数线性回归</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(r) = C r^{-s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 两边取对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log f(r) = \\log C - s \\log r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">({\\log r}, {\\log f(r)})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 做最小二乘。实务上只用排名前若干千的词拟合，尾部因为噪声与归一化不彻底会显著偏离直线，纳入回归会系统性高估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"zipf-拟合的两个用途\">Zipf 拟合的两个用途</h3><p>拟合 Zipf 参数有两个实际用途。一是<strong>外推容量</strong>：知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 与总量后可以估计任一词量级区间的请求总和，用于容量规划（与 <a href=\"../query-trend-seasonality/query-volume-forecast\">query 流量预测</a> 对接）。二是<strong>异常检测</strong>：如果某天的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 突然变化而总量不变，说明流量的结构变了，即使总量指标看起来正常，也值得追查。</p>\n<p>要注意 Zipf 只是近似，真实分布在中段常有平台区（大量同量级的品类词），尾部则因为归一化不彻底而被人为拉长。归一化覆盖率越低，尾部越虚高——<a href=\"../query-clustering/query-normalize-merge\">等价/同义 query 归一聚合</a> 做得好不好，直接决定了这条尾部的真实长度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"帕累托视角与头部集中度\">帕累托视角与头部集中度</h3><p>Zipf 描述的是「频率随排名如何衰减」，帕累托描述的是「多少比例的对象贡献多少比例的总量」。两者是同一现象的两个侧面。对按频次降序排列的序列，<strong>累计占比</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(k) = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{k} f(i)}{\\sum_{i=1}^{n} f(i)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7539em;vertical-align:-0.57em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1839em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7047em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1786em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8971em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3214em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.535em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.927em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1786em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3214em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.57em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是那条洛伦兹曲线的纵轴；头部集中度可用基尼系数刻画</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi>i</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = \\frac{2 \\sum_{i=1}^{n} i \\, f_{(i)}}{n \\sum_{i=1}^{n} f_{(i)}} - \\frac{n + 1}{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.599em;vertical-align:-1.0495em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5495em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3057em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0495em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{(i)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0496em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为升序排列的第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个频次。基尼系数越接近 1，流量越集中于少数词；它比「头部有多少个词」这种绝对计数更适合做跨期对比，因为它不依赖分层边界的选取。</p>\n<h3 id=\"累计占比与分层的-sql\">累计占比与分层的 SQL</h3><p>分层的实现是「按频次降序 → 累计求和 → 按份额阈值打标 → 分组统计」。下面这段一次给出每层的词量、请求量与占比，并用与其他天的对比体现层间流动：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH ranked AS (&#10;  SELECT dt, query,&#10;         SUM(req_cnt)                                     AS req_cnt,&#10;         ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY dt ORDER BY SUM(req_cnt) DESC) AS rk&#10;  FROM query_agg_daily&#10;  GROUP BY dt, query&#10;),&#10;cum AS (&#10;  SELECT dt, query, req_cnt, rk,&#10;         SUM(req_cnt) OVER (PARTITION BY dt ORDER BY rk)  AS cum_cnt,&#10;         SUM(req_cnt) OVER (PARTITION BY dt)              AS total_cnt&#10;  FROM ranked&#10;),&#10;tagged AS (&#10;  SELECT dt, query, req_cnt, rk,&#10;         CASE&#10;           WHEN cum_cnt / total_cnt &lt;= 0.50 THEN &#39;head&#39;&#10;           WHEN cum_cnt / total_cnt &lt;= 0.90 THEN &#39;torso&#39;&#10;           ELSE &#39;tail&#39;&#10;         END                                              AS tier&#10;  FROM cum&#10;)&#10;SELECT dt, tier,&#10;       COUNT(*)                       AS unique_queries,&#10;       SUM(req_cnt)                   AS req_cnt,&#10;       SUM(req_cnt) / MAX(total_cnt)  AS share&#10;FROM tagged JOIN (SELECT DISTINCT dt, total_cnt FROM cum) t USING (dt)&#10;GROUP BY dt, tier&#10;ORDER BY dt, tier;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt, query,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req_cnt)                                     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> req_cnt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         ROW_NUMBER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req_cnt) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query_agg_daily</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt, query</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt, query, req_cnt, rk,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req_cnt) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rk)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cum_cnt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req_cnt) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt)              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_cnt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tagged </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt, query, req_cnt, rk,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cum_cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'head'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cum_cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'torso'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tail'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                              AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt, tier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unique_queries,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req_cnt)                   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> req_cnt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req_cnt) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total_cnt)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> share</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tagged </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt, total_cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cum) t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt, tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt, tier;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>cum_cnt / total_cnt &lt;= 0.50</code> 这个判据把「头部」定义成「累计占一半流量所需的那些词」，因此头部的词数会随日期自然浮动——这正是分层该有的行为，也提醒了跨期对比必须固定边界（见下文口径部分）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"头部的价值与-头部陷阱\">头部的价值与「头部陷阱」</h2><h3 id=\"杠杆率与人工运营的边界\">杠杆率与人工运营的边界</h3><p>头部的战略价值在于杠杆率：改动一个头部词的召回策略，可能影响全站几个百分点的转化。因此头部通常配有<strong>人工运营</strong>——运营同学实际去看这个 query 的结果、判断该不该补词、该不该调运营位、该不该做专题页。这种&quot;人在环里&quot;的投入只在头部经济上成立。</p>\n<p>但头部有一个常见陷阱：<strong>过度关注头部导致对变化的迟钝</strong>。头部词稳定、熟悉、有历史基线，团队容易把精力全放在上面，而真正的增量机会往往出现在躯干段——那些量级中等、正在快速增长、还没被运营覆盖的词。一个健康的分析流程应当同时报告「头部份额的变化」与「躯干/尾部中增长最快的片段」，而不是只盯着头部排名。</p>\n<p>另一个陷阱是<strong>头部与长尾的割裂</strong>。头部词的表现往往由它的长尾变体共同决定：<code>蓝牙耳机</code> 的转化率低，可能是因为用户搜完头部发现不合适，转向 <code>蓝牙耳机 降噪 500以内</code> 这类长尾长句。只看头部会误判为「头部词效果差」，实际上问题出在头部结果没有覆盖长尾所表达的精细需求。这就是为什么头部与长尾必须放在同一张分析表里看。</p>\n<h2 id=\"长尾的真实构成与挖掘价值\">长尾的真实构成与挖掘价值</h2><h3 id=\"躯干是自动化甜区-真长尾只能当集合\">躯干是自动化甜区，真长尾只能当集合</h3><p>长尾的每一段价值密度不同。<strong>中频躯干</strong>是自动化收益最高的段：这些词有足够的量级支撑统计显著性，又没有多到需要人工，正是同义词归一、query 改写、排序泛化这些自动化手段的甜区。<strong>真长尾</strong>则相反，单条词没有统计意义，必须当作<strong>集合</strong>来分析——不问「<code>某小众型号 黑色 全新 未拆封</code> 怎么样」，而问「这一批两百多万条罕见长句的共同特征是什么」。</p>\n<p>对真长尾，唯一可行的分析姿势是<strong>语义聚合</strong>：把它们按句向量聚成主题，再看主题级的量级与转化。这正是 <a href=\"../query-clustering/query-similarity-cluster\">Query 相似度聚类与主题发现</a> 存在的理由之一——把不可分析的长尾压成可分析的少数主题。聚合之后往往发现，看似杂乱的长尾其实指向一小批真实需求，只是表达方式极度多样。</p>\n<p>长尾还有一个必须量化的属性：<strong>成本</strong>。长尾词命中缓存的概率低（每个词出现次数少），每次都要走完整链路，且难以为其预设同义词。因此长尾的单位请求成本显著高于头部。分析时要给出「长尾请求占比 × 长尾单位成本」的总额，让成本优化有据可依（缓存策略见 58 系列的搜索查询缓存与预热系统）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"交叉分析与分层报表\">交叉分析与分层报表</h2><h3 id=\"五张最有信息量的交叉表\">五张最有信息量的交叉表</h3><p>单独的分层数字价值有限，必须与维度交叉。最有信息量的几张交叉表是：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>交叉维度</th>\n<th>头部表现</th>\n<th>尾部表现</th>\n<th>结论方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>转化率</td>\n<td>高且稳定</td>\n<td>低且波动</td>\n<td>尾部可能是探索型需求，转化本就不该高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零结果率</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>尾部供给覆盖不足，见 <a href=\"../query-supply-gap/unmet-demand-discover\">未满足需求发现</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改写触发率</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>尾部更依赖查询改写，改写质量影响尾部体验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单请求延迟</td>\n<td>低（缓存命中）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>长尾延迟是体验短板，也是成本大头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新词占比</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>尾部是趋势的发源地，见 <a href=\"../query-clustering/emerging-query-detect\">新兴 query 发现</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>读这张表的通用原则是：<strong>尾部的问题不是尾部本身的问题，而是供给与系统对其覆盖不足的问题</strong>。尾部零结果率高，不代表用户搜错了，而代表长尾需求没被满足——这恰恰是选品机会的来源。</p>\n<p>分层报表还要注意一个口径问题：分层边界会随归一化改版而移动。归一化把更多词合并后，同一批流量所属的层会变（词少了，累计份额曲线变陡），所以<strong>跨版本的层间对比必须固定分层边界</strong>，用同一套词表划分，否则看到的变化可能只是口径漂移。这与意图分布表的版本管理是同一个道理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程要点与常见误区\">工程要点与常见误区</h2><h3 id=\"分层统计只需一次排序加累计\">分层统计只需一次排序加累计</h3><p>计算分层统计在亿级数据上并不轻松，但比聚类便宜得多，因为它只是一次排序加累计求和。关键是把「按 query 聚合」这一步做好：先归一化再聚合，否则同一需求被拆在多个层里，头部显得更小、尾部显得更长。聚合结果落一张小表（几十万行）即可支撑分析，无需反复扫明细。</p>\n<p>三个常见误区。<strong>误区一：把长尾等同于无用</strong>。长尾单条价值低，但作为集合它是新需求的雷达，也是 GMV 的组成部分；只看头部会错过增长。<strong>误区二：用绝对词数描述长尾</strong>。「尾部有一亿个词」这个数字本身不说明任何问题，要用「尾部贡献多少请求、多少转化、多少成本」来描述。<strong>误区三：忽视分层的时间稳定性</strong>。一个词今天在躯干、下周可能进头部，分层是快照而非身份；报表应当同时给出层内成员流动率，流动率高说明需求结构在快速变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>量级分布要按累计份额切成头部、躯干、尾部三段，而不是笼统的「长尾」。</li>\n<li>分布近似服从 Zipf 定律，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 参数可用于容量外推与结构异常检测；归一化覆盖不足会人为拉长尾部。</li>\n<li>头部的价值在杠杆率，配得上人工运营；但要警惕「头部陷阱」——真正的增量常在躯干段。</li>\n<li>头部与长尾必须同表分析，很多头部问题其实源于长尾表达的精细需求未被覆盖。</li>\n<li>躯干是自动化手段的甜区；真长尾只能作为集合做语义聚合，先把不可分析压成可分析。</li>\n<li>长尾的单位成本更高，必须显式量化「长尾请求占比 × 单位成本」。</li>\n<li>分层边界随归一化改版漂移，跨版本对比要固定边界。</li>\n<li>长尾零结果率高是选品信号，不是用户错误；尾部是新需求与趋势的发源地。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>继续读 <a href=\"session-query-flow\">会话内 query 流转路径</a>，看单次搜索之外的序列结构如何揭示用户在长尾里反复试探的过程。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"头部 vs 长尾 query 分析","id":"头部-vs-长尾-query-分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"按累计份额切成三段","id":"按累计份额切成三段"},{"level":2,"text":"Zipf 定律与分布拟合","id":"zipf-定律与分布拟合"},{"level":3,"text":"Zipf 参数与业务信号","id":"zipf-参数与业务信号"},{"level":3,"text":"Zipf 拟合的两个用途","id":"zipf-拟合的两个用途"},{"level":3,"text":"帕累托视角与头部集中度","id":"帕累托视角与头部集中度"},{"level":3,"text":"累计占比与分层的 SQL","id":"累计占比与分层的-sql"},{"level":2,"text":"头部的价值与「头部陷阱」","id":"头部的价值与-头部陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"杠杆率与人工运营的边界","id":"杠杆率与人工运营的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"长尾的真实构成与挖掘价值","id":"长尾的真实构成与挖掘价值"},{"level":3,"text":"躯干是自动化甜区，真长尾只能当集合","id":"躯干是自动化甜区-真长尾只能当集合"},{"level":2,"text":"交叉分析与分层报表","id":"交叉分析与分层报表"},{"level":3,"text":"五张最有信息量的交叉表","id":"五张最有信息量的交叉表"},{"level":2,"text":"工程要点与常见误区","id":"工程要点与常见误区"},{"level":3,"text":"分层统计只需一次排序加累计","id":"分层统计只需一次排序加累计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"按意图/品类的 query 分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/query-log-analytics-insight/intent-distribution/intent-category-distribution"},"next":{"title":"会话内 query 流转路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/query-log-analytics-insight/intent-distribution/session-query-flow"}}